OL,3,ALandslide at unlicensed Colombian gold
OL,4,Amine kills 13
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 13 workers have been killed
OL,7,Fand another seven injured in a
OL,8,Flandslide at an unlicensed mine in
OL,9,Fsouthern Colombia, local officials say.
OL,11,FWitnesses described hearing what they
OL,12,Fsaid sounded like an explosion at the
OL,13,Fopen-air artisanal gold mine on
OL,14,FWednesday afternoon, moments before the
OL,15,Fworkers below were trapped. But a local
OL,16,Fofficial said the deadly landslide had
OL,17,Fbeen caused by the mining work.
OL,19,FEmergency workers were able to retrieve
OL,20,Fthe bodies with the help of diggers.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
